abstract: >-
  Pair-exchange Metropolis sampling for the two-dimensional Ising lattice gas at fixed composition,
  with exact finite-state checks of the sampler and a replicated comparison of the energy-variance
  peak with the exact coexistence curve.
keywords:
  - Ising model
  - Kawasaki dynamics
  - Monte Carlo
  - phase coexistence
  - segregation
